{"id":"2d6a8203c0121eb0","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-cea.md","title":"相对可枚举且在其上","display":"df-cea — 相对可枚举且在其上","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-cea","aliases":["43-df-cea"],"display":"df-cea — 相对可枚举且在其上","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.13, print pp.55–57 / PDF pp.75–77","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-cea"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-cea</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cea — 相对可枚举且在其上"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.13, print pp.55–57 / PDF pp.75–77"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CEA}(A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CE}^{B}(A)\\land B\\le_TA.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CEA}(A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CE}^{B}(A)\\land B\\le_TA.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>记号CEA(A,B)对应原书“A is CEA(B)”。必须同时满足相对枚举与归约下界。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§5.13, print pp.55–57 / PDF pp.75–77。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal O$。 $\\mathcal O$、$\\operatorname{AsSet}$、$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSequence}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CEA}(A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CE}^{B}(A)\\land B\\le_TA.","display":true}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-cea]] — 相对可枚举且在其上"},{"id":"28b8edbf5da834bc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$、$\\operatorname{CEA}(X,B)$、$<_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-cea]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"5a931a43bfad7293","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CEA}$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、跳跃与 $\\equiv_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-cea]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","0784d1de3a88cd94","565c3258eee2a5ff"]}